  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "Add diced onion and bell pepper and cook until tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Add canned black beans, taco seasoning, and 1 cup of water to the skillet. Stir to combine.",
    "Bring the mixture to a simmer and cook for 5 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Warm taco shells according to package instructions.",
    "Assemble the tacos by spooning the bean mixture into the shells and topping with salsa, shredded cheese, and any desired toppings, such as sour cream and cilantro.",
    "Serve immediately and garnish with lime wedges, if desired."
